From: coolsnowwolf <coolsnowwolf@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: support backports 6.18

The latest mt76 NAN implementation requires the full NAN data and scheduling
stack from newer mac80211. Keep backports 6.18.39 and disable only MT7925 NAN
until that wireless stack is updated. Use the backports 6.18 action union and
interface combination layout. All unrelated mt76 fixes remain enabled.

Signed-off-by: coolsnowwolf <coolsnowwolf@gmail.com>
